{
  "uid": "v2-logs",
  "title": "v2 · Logs (unified Loki)",
  "tags": ["packiot-v2", "logs"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "Service",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "packiot-loki" },
        "query": "label_values(service)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": ["All"], "value": ["$__all"] }
      },
      {
        "name": "level",
        "label": "Level",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "info,warn,error,debug",
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "multi": true,
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": ["All"], "value": ["$__all"] }
      },
      {
        "name": "search",
        "label": "Search",
        "type": "textbox",
        "current": { "value": "" },
        "query": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Unified logs — every service, one board\nAll logs flow through promtail → Loki with labels **service, container, logstream, level**. There is **no `tenant` label on logs** — logs are per-container, not per-factory; scope by `$service` instead. `$service` is populated live from `label_values(service)` (never a hardcoded list — v1's per-service boards rotted as services came and went). Filter by `$level` and free-text `$search`. The pipeline row at the bottom pins `plc-sim | edge-transformer` (the staging ingest path)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Log volume by level",
      "description": "sum by(level)(count_over_time({service=~\"$service\"} [1m])). Shows the promtail-parsed level label. A rising error/warn line is the cue to open the logs panel below.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "packiot-loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 3 },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short", "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" }, "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 12, "showPoints": "never", "stacking": { "mode": "normal", "group": "A" } } },
        "overrides": [
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "error" }, "properties": [ { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } } ] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "warn" }, "properties": [ { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "orange" } } ] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "info" }, "properties": [ { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "green" } } ] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "debug" }, "properties": [ { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" } } ] }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "packiot-loki" },
          "expr": "sum by (level) (count_over_time({service=~\"$service\"} [1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{level}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Error rate (line-content match)",
      "description": "sum(count_over_time({service=~\"$service\"} |~ \"(?i)(error|panic|fatal)\" [1m])) — catches errors even when the level label is missing or wrong. Healthy = flat 0.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "packiot-loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 3 },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" }, "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 15, "showPoints": "auto" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "packiot-loki" },
          "expr": "sum by (service) (count_over_time({service=~\"$service\"} |~ \"(?i)(error|panic|fatal)\" [1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Logs — {service=~\"$service\", level=~\"$level\"} |~ \"$search\"",
      "description": "The main tail. Narrow with the $service / $level pickers and the $search free-text box (leave $search empty to match everything).",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "packiot-loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 16, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 11 },
      "options": { "showLabels": false, "showTime": true, "sortOrder": "Descending", "wrapLogMessage": true, "prettifyLogMessage": false, "enableLogDetails": true, "dedupStrategy": "none" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "packiot-loki" },
          "expr": "{service=~\"$service\", level=~\"$level\"} |~ \"$search\"",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Pipeline (plc-sim → edge-transformer)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 27 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Pipeline log volume by service",
      "description": "sum by(service)(count_over_time({service=~\"plc-sim|edge-transformer\"} [1m])) — the staging ingest path's throughput proxy.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "packiot-loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 28 },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" }, "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "packiot-loki" },
          "expr": "sum by (service) (count_over_time({service=~\"plc-sim|edge-transformer\"} [1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "plc-sim (staging source)",
      "description": "The synthetic PLC feeding staging. Filtered by $search.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "packiot-loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 36 },
      "options": { "showLabels": false, "showTime": true, "sortOrder": "Descending", "wrapLogMessage": true, "prettifyLogMessage": false, "enableLogDetails": true, "dedupStrategy": "none" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "packiot-loki" },
          "expr": "{service=\"plc-sim\"} |~ \"$search\"",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "edge-transformer (ingest)",
      "description": "MQTT ingest → calc → triple-emit. Filtered by $search.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "packiot-loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 36 },
      "options": { "showLabels": false, "showTime": true, "sortOrder": "Descending", "wrapLogMessage": true, "prettifyLogMessage": false, "enableLogDetails": true, "dedupStrategy": "none" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "packiot-loki" },
          "expr": "{service=\"edge-transformer\"} |~ \"$search\"",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
